  "interpretation": [
    "FAO-56 season lengths are examples from named regions and planting periods, not universal crop durations or optimums.",
    "FAO-56 Kc values describe well-managed, non-stressed crops under the climate and reference-ET assumptions stated in Table 12. They are coefficients for estimating ETc from local ETo, not seasonal water volumes.",
    "Root depth and depletion fraction p are irrigation-management guidance. FAO-56 notes p varies with ETc and weather; values shown are table values at ETc approximately 5 mm/day.",
    "No crop suitability scores or planting recommendations are generated from these data."
  ],
